  message: "Fixed in PR #2824. FileAnalysis gains method_return_types dict. Go: new _go_return_type_from_signature extracts return types from signature strings (handles tuple returns with error picking, pointer stripping, package qualifier stripping). Pass 1 populates registry for both methods (ReceiverType.MethodName) and functions (FuncName). Aggregated across files after Pass 1. Wired into _extract_go_var_types as a fallback after existing _type_from_rhs rules. Java: registry populated from existing meta['return_type'] for consistency; Java already has inline return-type chaining during edge extraction. 15 unit tests for the signature parser, 3 integration tests (grammar-gated). Bakeoff validation deferred to next bakeoff-deep cycle."  # dab1
